  "description": "CodeVerse 2.0 – Overnight Hackathon | Metaversity Club, VIT Bhopal University CodeVerse 2.0 is a national-level overnight hackathon organized by Metaversity Club, VIT Bhopal University, bringing together passionate coders, developers, and innovators to build creative, technology-driven solutions. With the theme \"Code. Compete. Innovate.\" , the hackathon provides participants with an opportunity to showcase their technical skills, collaborate in teams, solve real-world problems, and compete for exciting rewards. Key Highlights & Perks: ₹30,000 worth of cash prizes for outstanding teams. Internship opportunities worth up to ₹25,000 for the Top 10 teams. Paid internship opportunities for all teams qualifying for the offline round. $2,500 worth of cloud credits and special goodies for winners. $50 worth of cloud credits , goodies, and refreshments for every participant. An exciting overnight experience featuring fun activities, old-school games like Rumal Chori and Chupan Chupai, and late-night jamming sessions. Event Structure: Round 1 (15–20 November 2026): Online qualification round hosted on HackerEarth. Round 2 (28–29 November 2026): Offline overnight hackathon at VIT Bhopal University. CodeVerse 2.0 is more than just a coding competition; it is an opportunity to learn, innovate, network, and experience an unforgettable hackathon atmosphere.",
