    "details": "<p><strong>CodeVerse 2.0 &ndash; Overnight Hackathon | Metaversity Club, VIT Bhopal University</strong></p>\n<p>CodeVerse 2.0 is a national-level overnight hackathon organized by Metaversity Club, VIT Bhopal University, bringing together passionate coders, developers, and innovators to build creative, technology-driven solutions.</p>\n<p>With the theme <strong>\"Code. Compete. Innovate.\"</strong>, the hackathon provides participants with an opportunity to showcase their technical skills, collaborate in teams, solve real-world problems, and compete for exciting rewards.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Highlights &amp; Perks:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>₹30,000 worth of cash prizes</strong> for outstanding teams.</li>\n<li><strong>Internship opportunities worth up to ₹25,000</strong> for the Top 10 teams.</li>\n<li>Paid internship opportunities for all teams qualifying for the offline round.</li>\n<li><strong>$2,500 worth of cloud credits</strong> and special goodies for winners.</li>\n<li><strong>$50 worth of cloud credits</strong>, goodies, and refreshments for every participant.</li>\n<li>An exciting overnight experience featuring fun activities, old-school games like Rumal Chori and Chupan Chupai, and late-night jamming sessions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Structure:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Round 1 (15&ndash;20 November 2026):</strong> Online qualification round hosted on HackerEarth.</li>\n<li><strong>Round 2 (28&ndash;29 November 2026):</strong> Offline overnight hackathon at VIT Bhopal University.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CodeVerse 2.0 is more than just a coding competition; it is an opportunity to learn, innovate, network, and experience an unforgettable hackathon atmosphere.</p>",
